msgstr "连接蜂鸣器和安全开关"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:67
#: f58642695e774397875027d9e0b697c2
msgid ""
"The buzzer and safety switch button are mandatory for Pixhawk. Connect to "
"the BUZZER and SWITCH ports as shown."
msgstr "蜂鸣器和安全开关按钮对 Pixhawk 是必需的。按图示连接到 BUZZER 和 SWITCH 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:75
#: 34b589e2a63d4d4896362b1d1db1da4f
msgid ""
"Mount the beeper at least 5cm away from the flight controller or the noise "
"may upset the accelerometers."
msgstr "将蜂鸣器安装在距飞控至少 5cm 处，否则噪声可能干扰加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:79
